@template shy
// One of the ten voice templates (the head writer, with social B). Its words match section 20c's VOICE_FALLBACK, so
// baking it changes nothing; the template's own lines (content/templates/shy.lines) come in wave 2.
talk: Quiet, short sentences, a word then a pause; warms up slowly.
hi: Oh! Hi | Um, hello
bye: See you | Bye, then
yes: Okay | If you like
thanks: Thanks. Really
wow: Oh, wow
sigh: Oh
nick: - | - | - | - | -
needs: listen
